OL,3,ABriton rescued in Nepal after deadly
OL,4,Afloods, army spokesperson says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British national has been rescued in
OL,7,FNepal alongside 118 Nepalese people, a
OL,8,Fspokesperson for the country's army
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FIt comes nearly a week after deadly
OL,12,Ffloods hit the country, killing more
OL,13,Fthan 1,000 people.
OL,15,FMore than 3,900 people remain missing.
OL,17,FThe British national has not yet been
OL,18,Fidentified.
